# Skybox Ferry (4/4 flying Vehicle, Crew 2): turn 3 it is only an artifact, a lone Memnite (power 1) can't crew it, and
# Grizzly Bears (power 2, summoning sick, which does not matter for a crew cost) can: the Ferry is an artifact creature
# with flying until end of turn. The crew lasts one turn only (still just an artifact on turn 4, creature again once crewed
# on turn 5), and on turn 5 the crewed Ferry attacks for 4 in the air.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Memnite
Skybox Ferry
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

